  "body": "We now have `once` option in `AddEventListenerOptions`, but wouldn't it be more convenient if there is a Promise-based API for that?\n\nProbably something like\n\n``` text\npartial interface EventTarget {\n  Promise<Event> on(DOMString type, optional EventListenerOptions options);\n}\n```\n\nand let it behave like `AddEventListenerOptions.once`?\n",
